/*
  VersionInfoWidget.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 dashboard widget · 0111 · VersionInfoWidget (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  `VersionInfoWidget` resolves (table "VersionInfoWidget") lives here with its
  web `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first block is the exact set of keys extracted from the web source
  (features/dashboard/widgets/VersionInfoWidget.tsx, values verbatim from
  web/src/i18n/en.json → widget.versionInfo.*). The remainder back the native
  chrome (freshness chip, refresh/retry, loading/error/empty copy, open
  affordance, accessibility) and the dashboard registry description.
*/

